2-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32l-21.3 0c-12.9 0-24.6-7.8-29.5-19.7l-6.3-15c-14.6-35.1-44.1-61.9-80.5-73.1l-48.7-15c-11.1-3.4-22.7-5.2-34.4-5.2c-31 0-60.8 12.3-82.7 34.3L57.4 153.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0l23.1-23.1zM91.2 352L32 352c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l69.6 0c19 0 36.2-11.2 43.9-28.5L157 361.6l-9.5-6c-17.5-10.9-30.5-26.8-37.9-44.9L91.2 352z"></path></svg> Concerto skills</div></div><div class="tab-inside "><div class="skills Electro"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-1 lg-1420:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Basic Attack</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Manifold Bloom</p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><h6>Basic Attack - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, perform up to <strong>4 </strong>consecutive attacks, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><h6>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, consume STA to deal <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2.</p></li></ul><h6>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form and in mid-air, press Normal Attack to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2.</p></li></ul><h6>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form and in mid-air, hold Normal Attack to cast Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease, continuously consuming STA and dealing <u>Electro DMG</u> to the target.<br>Switching to another Resonator ends the skill action immediately.</p></li></ul><h6>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</h6><ul><li><p>When the Normal Attack button is released during Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease, Hsin casts Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease , consuming STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox upon landing and dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting Mid-air Attack- Answering Form: Reign at Ease, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2.</p></li></ul><h6>Dodge Counter - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, press Normal Attack within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3.</p></li></ul><h6>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and not in the Mechanism Dominion state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to <strong>3</strong> consecutive attacks, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>Casting Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1 generates a Modular Heartlock at the target's position. Casting Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2, Heavy Attack - Illumining Form, Dodge Counter - Illumining Form, or Resonance Skill - Illumining Form causes the Modular Heartlock to collapse, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>Casting this skill consumes STA when Hsin is in mid-air.</p></li></ul><h6>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form, consume STA to command Xuanfang Mechanisms, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3.</p></li></ul><h6>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and on the ground, press Jump to cast this skill, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><h6>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and Hsin is in mid-air, Resonance Skill - Illumining Form is replaced with Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form.</p></li><li><p>Consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><h6>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form, press Normal Attack within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3.</p></li></ul><h6>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and in the Mechanism Dominion state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to <strong>4</strong> consecutive attacks, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><h6>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and in the Mechanism Dominion state, press Normal Attack within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 3.</p></li></ul><p></p></div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion pw-accordion-multis" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_1f_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_1e_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item="">Multipliers</button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_1f_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_1e_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 1547.438232421875px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 393.61798095703125px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="level-changer"><span class="current-level">Lv. <span class="level" style="color: rgb(180, 107, 255);">10</span></span><div class="level-slider false"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="transform: scale(1); cursor: pointer; height: 36px; display: flex; width: 100%;"><div style="height: 5px; width: 100%; border-radius: 0px; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(180, 107, 255) 0%, rgb(180, 107, 255) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%); align-self: center;"><div tabindex="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuenow="10" draggable="false" aria-label="Accessibility label" role="slider" style="position: absolute; z-index: 0; cursor: grab; user-select: none; touch-action: none; height: 20px; width: 20px; border-radius: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><div style="height: 14px; width: 5px; background-color: rgb(72, 73, 80);"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="multipliers inside"><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 1 DMG</div><div class="value">27.84%+41.76%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2 DMG</div><div class="value">15.15%*2+68.14%+53.00%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3 DMG</div><div class="value">31.51%*2+23.63%*2+47.26%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4 DMG</div><div class="value">39.72%+39.72%+119.15%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease DMG</div><div class="value">27.84%*25</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease DMG</div><div class="value">22.44%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Answering Form DMG</div><div class="value">10.28%+20.55%+10.28%+20.55%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack - Answering Form DMG</div><div class="value">22.44%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Dodge Counter - Answering Form DMG</div><div class="value">44.98%*2+67.47%+67.47%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1 DMG</div><div class="value">12.55%*2+37.65%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Modular Heartlock DMG</div><div class="value">20.92%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2 DMG</div><div class="value">34.80%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3 DMG</div><div class="value">9.11%*4+18.21%*2+27.31%*4</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Illumining Form DMG</div><div class="value">53.93%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Upward Cut - Illumining Form DMG</div><div class="value">35.03%+52.54%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form DMG</div><div class="value">13.47%+8.98%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Dodge Counter - Illumining Form DMG</div><div class="value">95.68%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 1 DMG</div><div class="value">28.86%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 2 DMG</div><div class="value">38.23%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 3 DMG</div><div class="value">21.35%*5</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 4 DMG</div><div class="value">16.64%*7+49.90%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned DMG</div><div class="value">66.07%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease STA Cost per Second</div><div class="value">5</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack Answering Form: Reign at Ease STA Cost</div><div class="value">30</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Answering Form STA Cost</div><div class="value">20</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack - Answering Form STA Cost</div><div class="value">30</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Heavy Attack - Illumining Form STA Cost</div><div class="value">20</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form STA Cost</div><div class="value">30</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Basic Attack - Illumining Form Mid-air STA Cost</div><div class="value">5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1 double-skills"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Resonance Skill</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Heartward by Moon</p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><h6>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, press Resonance Skill to deal <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4.<br>Can be cast in mid-air.</p></li><li><p>If Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, She turns into the Moon Fox. </p><ul><li><p>While turned into the Moon Fox and out of combat, Hsin gains Dustless Tread. With Dustless Tread, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. Dustless Tread is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the Moon Fox form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.</p></li><li><p>While turned into the Moon Fox and out of combat, Hsin restores 6% of Max HP every 3s.</p></li><li><p>Taking damage, failing to perform a Dodge with directional input while on the ground, or Dodging in mid-air will end the Moon Fox form. Switching to another Resonator or pressing Resonance Skill also ends the Moon Fox form. Press Normal Attack to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4, which also ends the Moon Fox form.</p></li><li><p>Resonance Liberation is disabled when Hsin is in the Moon Fox form.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h6>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form and Hsin is on the ground, press Resonance Skill to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><p></p></div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion pw-accordion-multis" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_1h_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_1g_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item="">Multipliers</button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_1h_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_1g_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 303.4382019042969px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 393.61798095703125px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="level-changer"><span class="current-level">Lv. <span class="level" style="color: rgb(180, 107, 255);">10</span></span><div class="level-slider false"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="transform: scale(1); cursor: pointer; height: 36px; display: flex; width: 100%;"><div style="height: 5px; width: 100%; border-radius: 0px; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(180, 107, 255) 0%, rgb(180, 107, 255) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%); align-self: center;"><div tabindex="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuenow="10" draggable="false" aria-label="Accessibility label" role="slider" style="position: absolute; z-index: 0; cursor: grab; user-select: none; touch-action: none; height: 20px; width: 20px; border-radius: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><div style="height: 14px; width: 5px; background-color: rgb(72, 73, 80);"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="multipliers inside"><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Resonance Skill - Answering Form DMG</div><div class="value">23.30%+23.30%+23.30%+15.53%*2+54.36%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Resonance Skill - Illumining Form DMG</div><div class="value">10.36%*4+165.65%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Resonance Skill - Answering Form Cooldown</div><div class="value">12</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Resonance Skill - Illumining Form Cooldown</div><div class="value">20</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Resonance Liberation</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Nexus Alight</p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><h6>Formshift</h6><ul><li><p>Casting Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer unlocks Formshift.</p></li><li><p>Cast Formshift to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin turns into Illumining Form, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the Heart Manifest state.</p></li><li><p>Can be cast in mid-air close to the ground.</p></li><li><p>While in Illumining Form, engaging in quest dialogue, performing a environmental interaction with an animation, or using a Utility switches Hsin back to Answering Form to perform the corresponding action.<br>While in Illumining Form, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in the deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in Illumining Form can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in Illumining Form and air-borne.</p></li></ul><h6>Pillars Across Heaven</h6><ul><li><p>Casting Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons unlocks Pillars Across Heaven.</p></li><li><p>Cast Pillars Across Heaven to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u> to the target, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li><li><p>Can be cast in mid-air close to the ground.</p></li><li><p>Hsin returns to Answering Form and exits the Heart Manifest state.</p></li></ul><h6>Edict</h6><ul><li><p>Casting Formshift grants Hsin 21 stacks of Edict for 45s. The effect cannot exceed 21 stacks and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.<br>After the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes Edict in the following <strong>3s </strong>trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the durtion:</p><ul><li><p>When Edict is consumed, summon a Soaring Pillar from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing Electro DMG. </p></li><li><p>Edict can be automatically consumed up to <strong>1 </strong>stack per second.</p></li><li><p>Damage dealt by Soaring Pillar does not trigger this effect.</p></li><li><p>When Hsin is knocked out, all Edict stacks are removed.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h6>Heart Manifest</h6><ul><li><p>Increases Hsin's resistance to interruption for <strong>45s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Entering the Heart Manifest state resets Hsin's Illumining Form.</p></li><li><p>While in the Heart Manifest state and in Illumining Form, if Pillars Across Heaven has not been unlocked, press Resonance Liberation to have Hsin cast Invoked Form: Answering. While in Answering Form, press Resonance Liberation to have Hsin cast Invoked Form: Illumining.</p></li></ul><h6>Invoked Form: Answering</h6><ul><li><p>Hsin temporarily reverts to Answering Form. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2; if She is in mid-air, She casts Mid-air Attack - Answering Form.</p></li></ul><h6>Invoked Form: Illumining</h6><ul><li><p>Hsin turns back into Illumining Form. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts Upward Cut - Illumining Form; if She is in mid-air, She casts Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form.</p></li></ul><p></p></div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion pw-accordion-multis" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_1j_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_1i_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item="">Multipliers</button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_1j_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_1i_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 367.4382019042969px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 393.61798095703125px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="level-changer"><span class="current-level">Lv. <span class="level" style="color: rgb(180, 107, 255);">10</span></span><div class="level-slider false"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="transform: scale(1); cursor: pointer; height: 36px; display: flex; width: 100%;"><div style="height: 5px; width: 100%; border-radius: 0px; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(180, 107, 255) 0%, rgb(180, 107, 255) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%); align-self: center;"><div tabindex="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuenow="10" draggable="false" aria-label="Accessibility label" role="slider" style="position: absolute; z-index: 0; cursor: grab; user-select: none; touch-action: none; height: 20px; width: 20px; border-radius: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><div style="height: 14px; width: 5px; background-color: rgb(72, 73, 80);"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="multipliers inside"><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Pillars Across Heaven DMG</div><div class="value">80.51%+90.57%+60.38%+100.64%+70.45%+1610.12%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Soaring Pillar DMG</div><div class="value">11.37%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Formshift Cooldown</div><div class="value">25</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Pillars Across Heaven Resonance Cost</div><div class="value">125</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Formshift Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">20</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Pillars Across Heaven Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">20</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Invoked Form Cooldown</div><div class="value">1.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tab-inside "><div class="skills Electro"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-1 lg-1420:grid-cols-1 gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Forte Circuit</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Forms Turn, Heart Abides</p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><h6>Forms Born of Heart</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, Hsin can gain and consume Answering Heart.</p></li><li><p>While in Illumining Form, Hsin can gain and consume Illumining Heart.</p></li></ul><h6>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</h6><ul><li><p>While in Answering Form, when Hsin's Answering Heart reaches <strong>100 </strong>points, Heavy Attack - Answering Form is replaced with Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer.</p></li><li><p>Hold Normal Attack to cast the skill at the cost of STA and <strong>100 </strong>points of Answering Heart. Hsin is immune to interruption during the action, and deals <u>Electro DMG</u> to the target, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li><li><p>Casting Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer grants Hsin Resolution of Wishes. This Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer consumes Resolution of Wishes to become Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector, dealing greater DMG. Resolution of Wishes can only be gained once every 24s.</p></li><li><p>While casting Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer or Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector, if Hsin is not in the Heart Manifest state, unlock Resonance Liberation - Formshift.</p></li></ul><h6>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form, when Hsin's Illumining Heart reaches <strong>0 </strong>during the Mechanism Dominion state, Heavy Attack - Illumining Form is replaced with Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons.</p></li><li><p>Hold Normal Attack to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u> to the target, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li><li><p>Casting Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons grants Hsin Law of Heaven. This Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons consumes Law of Heaven to become Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons, dealing greater DMG. Law of Heaven can only be gained once every <strong>24s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Casting Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons or Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons ends the Mechanism Dominion state and unlocks Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven.<br>Can be cast in mid-air.</p></li></ul><h6>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</h6><ul><li><p>While in Illumining Form, when Hsin's Illumining Heart reaches 300 points and She is on the ground, Resonance Skill is replaced with Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned.</p></li><li><p>When Hsin is on the ground, press Resonance Skill to deal <u>Electro DMG</u> to surrounding targets, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li><li><p>Casting Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned sends Hsin into the Mechanism Dominion state.</p></li></ul><p>Mechanism Dominion</p><ul><li><p>The Mechanism Dominion state lasts <strong>13s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>While this state is active, Basic Attack - Illumining Form is replaced with Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned, and Dodge Counter - Illumining Form is replaced with Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned.</p></li><li><p>When Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned or Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned hits a target, Illumining Heart is consumed if Hsin is the active Resonator.</p></li><li><p>Exiting Mechanism Dominion clears Illumining Heart.</p></li></ul><h6>Resonance Mode - Unison</h6><ul><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison, Hsin gains the following effects:</p><ul><li><p>Hsin can trigger Unison Response, but not in Co-op Mode.</p></li><li><p>After casting Intro Skill - Answering Form or Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison, the next Resonance Liberation - Formshift grants Hsin Unison for 5s.</p></li><li><p>When Hsin triggers Unison Response, She gains Source Intent, and the Intro Skill cast this time is replaced with Intro Skill - Manifold Unison, dealing greater DMG.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>When Hsin casts an Intro Skill without triggering Unison Response while holding Source Intent, She consumes Source Intent instead, and the Intro Skill is replaced with Intro Skill - Manifold Unison, dealing greater DMG.</p><ul><li><p>The effects on Hsin mentioned above are removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.</p></li><li><p>Casting Intro Skill - Illumining Form or Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison sends Hsin directly into the Mechanism Dominion state.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h6>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</h6><ul><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare, Hsin gains the following effects:</p><ul><li><p>When Hsin enters combat, targets within a certain range do not lose Electro Flare stacks when it's triggered.</p></li><li><p>After Resonators in the team inflict Electro Rage to a target, every <strong>1 </strong>stack of Electro Rage inflicted grants Hsin <strong>1 </strong>stack of Heart of Thunder, stacking up to <strong>100 </strong>times, and consumes all Electro Rage stacks from that target. Heart of Thunder is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.</p></li><li><p>At the last stage of Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon, Hsin actively triggers <strong>1</strong> instance of Electro Flare DMG on the targets. Its DMG Multiplier is equal to<strong> 35%</strong> x (the number of Heart of Thunder stacks on Hsin) x (the Electro Flare DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current Electro Flare stacks).</p></li></ul></li><li><p>While casting Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early will end the above effects early.</p></li><li><p>Some time after casting Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of Heart of Thunder.</p></li><li><p>When Hsin has at least <strong>50 </strong>stacks of Heart of Thunder, Resonance Skill - Illumining Form stagnates nearby targets during the action.</p><ul><li><p>After casting Resonance Liberation - Formshift, inflict <strong>5 </strong>stacks of Electro Flare on nearby targets within a certain range. It also makes Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned or Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned inflict Electro Flare on hit targets, up to <strong>5 </strong>times. Casting Resonance Liberation - Formshift again resets this count. Switching Resonance Mode removes it.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned and Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons inflict <strong>5</strong> stacks of Electro Flare on the target hit. Intro Skill - Illumining Form, Intro Skill - Answering Form, and Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector inflict <strong>1</strong> stack of Electro Flare on the target hit.</p></li></ul><h6>Unison</h6><ul><li><p>While Hsin is in Resonance Mode - Unison with Unison, switching to another Resonator will remove Hsin's Unison to trigger Hsin's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. If Hsin has full Concerto Energy and Unison at the same time, only Unison is consumed to trigger the effect.</p></li></ul><h6>Unison Response</h6><ul><li><p>While Hsin is in Resonance Mode - Unison and the active Resonator in the team has Unison, Hsin triggers Unison Response when She is switched in and casts Intro Skill, granting <strong>1</strong> stack of Unison Boon to all Resonators in the team for <strong>30s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Hsin can only grant up to <strong>1 </strong>stack of Unison Boon in this way.</p></li></ul><h6>Unison Boon</h6><ul><li><p>Only the Resonators who can trigger Unison Reponse can gain this effect. Each stack of Unison Boon increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators who can trigger Unison Response in the team by 3%, stacking up to <strong>2 </strong>times.</p></li></ul><h6>Answering Heart</h6><ul><li><p>Can hold up to <strong>100 </strong>points of Answering Heart.</p></li><li><p>While in Answering Form, when Normal Attack - Answering Form, Resonance Skill - Answering Form, Intro Skill - Answering Form, or Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison hits a target, Hsin gains Answering Heart if She is the active Resonator.<br>Casting Intro Skill - Answering Form or Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison grants <strong>60 </strong>points of Answering Heart.</p></li></ul><h6>Illumining Heart</h6><ul><li><p>Can hold up to <strong>300 </strong>points of Illumining Heart.</p></li><li><p>While in Illumining Form and not in the Mechanism Dominion state, when Normal Attack - Illumining Form, or Resonance Skill - Illumining Form hits a target, Hsin gains Illumining Heart if She is the active Resonator.</p><ul><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison, casting Intro Skill - Illumining Form or Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison directly sends Hsin into the Mechanism Dominion state and grants 300 points of Illumining Heart.</p></li><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare, after casting Resonance Liberation - Formshift, when the Modular Heartlock generated by Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1 is collapsed by Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2, Heavy Attack - Illumining Form, Dodge Counter - Illumining Form, or Resonance Skill - Illumining Form, gain <strong>150 </strong>points of Illumining Heart if Hsin is the active Resonator. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of Resonance Liberation - Formshift resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p></p></div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion pw-accordion-multis" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_1l_" aria-expanded="true" 