sonance Mode ends this effect.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare, after Resonators in the team inflict Electro Flare, Hsin gains <strong>25% </strong><u>Electro DMG Bonus</u>, stacking up to <strong>2 </strong>times. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, when Rover: Electro casts Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury, both Hsin and Rover: Electro gain <strong>20% </strong><u>Electro DMG Bonus</u> for <strong>30s</strong>.</p><p>This effect resets when a Resonator is added to the team or when Hsin switches Resonance Mode. </p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Inherent Skill</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Gleaning Simple Joys </p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison, the maximum stacks of the Unison Boon effect on Resonators in the team are increased by <strong>1</strong>. When a Resonator in the team triggers Unison Response, all Resonators in the team gain <strong>1 </strong>stack of Unison Boon for <strong>30s</strong>. This effect does not stack.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare and Hsin is not in the Heart Manifest state, Hsin gains <strong>1 </strong>stack of Thunderglow after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict Electro Flare, stacking up to <strong>10 </strong>times.</p><p>While Hsin is in the Heart Manifest state, when targets within a certain range have <strong>0 </strong>stacks of Electro Flare, inflict <strong>1 </strong>stack of Electro Flare on the targets. If Thunderglow on Hsin reaches the stack limit, Hsin also inflicts Fleeting Thunder on the targets:</p><ul><li><p>When Hsin inflicts Fleeting Thunder on the target, She also inflicts Electro Flare on the target to the stack limit, up to <strong>16 </strong>stacks of Electro Flare.</p></li><li><p>When Fleeting Thunder is active, if the maximum stacks of Electro Flare on the target are increased, Hsin will inflict Electro Flare on the target to the stack limit again, up to <strong>16 </strong>stacks of Electro Flare.</p></li><li><p>Fleeting Thunder will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.</p></li></ul><p>Exiting the Heart Manifest state or switching Resonance Mode removes the effects mentioned above. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tab-inside active"><div class="skills Electro"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-1 lg-1420:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Intro Skill</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Glance on a Whim </p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><h6>Intro Skill - Answering Form</h6><ul><li><p>This skill becomes available while in Answering Form. Attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3 (when in Resonance Mode - Unison) or Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4 (when in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare).</p></li></ul><h6>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</h6><ul><li><p>The skill becomes available when in Answering Form. Attack the target, dealing greater <u>Electro DMG</u>, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li><li><p>After casting this skill, press Normal Attack within a short time to cast Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3.</p></li></ul><h6>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</h6><ul><li><p>This skill becomes available while in Illumining Form. Attack the target, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u>.</p></li></ul><h6>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</h6><ul><li><p>The skill becomes available when in Illumining Form. Attack the target, dealing greater <u>Electro DMG</u>, considered Resonance Skill DMG.</p></li></ul><p></p></div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion pw-accordion-multis" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_1n_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_1m_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item="">Multipliers</button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_1n_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_1m_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 951.438232421875px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 393.61798095703125px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="level-changer"><span class="current-level">Lv. <span class="level" style="color: rgb(180, 107, 255);">10</span></span><div class="level-slider false"><div role="button" tabindex="0" style="transform: scale(1); cursor: pointer; height: 36px; display: flex; width: 100%;"><div style="height: 5px; width: 100%; border-radius: 0px; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(180, 107, 255) 0%, rgb(180, 107, 255) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%, rgb(72, 73, 80) 100%); align-self: center;"><div tabindex="0" aria-valuemax="10" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuenow="10" draggable="false" aria-label="Accessibility label" role="slider" style="position: absolute; z-index: 0; cursor: grab; user-select: none; touch-action: none; height: 20px; width: 20px; border-radius: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><div style="height: 14px; width: 5px; background-color: rgb(72, 73, 80);"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="multipliers inside"><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Answering Form: Electro Flare DMG</div><div class="value">7.88%*2+7.88%*2+126.02%</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Answering Form: Unison DMG</div><div class="value">10.28%+20.55%+10.28%+20.55%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison DMG</div><div class="value">60.59%+121.18%+60.59%+121.18%*3</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Electro Flare DMG</div><div class="value">11.42%*4+11.42%*2+39.97%*4</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Unison DMG</div><div class="value">56.59%*4+5.66%+11.32%*2+14.15%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison DMG</div><div class="value">157.22%*4+15.73%+31.45%*2+39.31%*2</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Answering Form Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">10</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">10</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Illumining Form Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">10</div></div><div class="multi-single"><div class="name">Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison Concerto Regen</div><div class="value">10</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box skill-new"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">Outro Skill</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Herself a Thousand Lanterns</p></div></div><div class="skill-details"><div class="skill-with-coloring Electro"><p>Attack the target, dealing <u>Electro DMG</u> equal to <strong>100% </strong>of Hsin's ATK.</p><p>Hsin gains Nightglow upon entering combat or casting Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven. When Hsin casts Outro Skill, Nightglow is consumed to trigger various effects depending on the Resonance Mode She is in:</p><ul><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain Shared Light when they gain Unison. After Hsin casts Outro Skill, Resonators with Shared Light gain <strong>20% </strong>All DMG Amplification for <strong>30s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare, <u>Electro DMG</u> dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified by <strong>20% </strong>for <strong>20s</strong>.</p></li></ul><p>The above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Resonance Chain (Dupes)</div><div class="skills dupes"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg-1420:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S1</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">A Boat to Cross the Rising Tide</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>Casting Resonance Liberation - Formshift grants Hsin <strong>2 </strong>stacks of Radiance Ward, stacking up to <strong>2 </strong>times. Switching to Answering Form clears all stacks. When Hsin takes DMG from an enemy target's attack, <strong>1 </strong>stack of Radiance Ward can be consumed to make Her immune to interruption and reduce DMG taken by <strong>60% </strong>for <strong>1s</strong>. This effect can be triggered once every <strong>1s</strong>.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison:<br>The DMG Multipliers of Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison and Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison are increased by<strong> 15%</strong>, and each stack of Unison Boon additionally increases the DMG Multipliers of Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison and Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison by <strong>10%</strong>, up to a total <strong>4 </strong>stacks.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare:</p><ul><li><p>When Hsin enters combat, if Heart of Thunder is below <strong>50 </strong>stacks, it is increased to <strong>50 </strong>stacks, triggered once every <strong>12s</strong>.</p></li><li><p>The DMG Multiplier of Electro Flare DMG dealt when Forte Circuit - Resonance Skill: Illumining Form hits a target and consumes <strong>5</strong> stacks of Heart of Thunder is increased to <strong>210%</strong>. The DMG Multiplier of Electro Flare DMG dealt when Forte Circuit - Resonance Skill: Heartward by Moon consumes all remaining Heart of Thunder at once is increased to <strong>42%</strong>.</p></li></ul><p></p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S2</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">To Wake Is to Wonder What I Am</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>The DMG Multipliers of Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer and Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector are increased by <strong>60%</strong>.</p><p>The DMG Multipliers of Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons and Heravy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons are increased by <strong>60%</strong>.</p><p>When Hsin enters combat, the Cooldowns for Hsin to gain Resolution of Wishes and Law of Heaven are reset. If Hsin is in Answering Form, <strong>100 </strong>additional points of Answering Heart are also restored. This effect can be triggered once every <strong>12s</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S3</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">A Dream of Return Among the Hills</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>The DMG Multiplier of Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven is increased by <strong>70%</strong>.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison:<br>The Crit. DMG of Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven is increased by <strong>20%</strong>, and each stack of Unison Boon additionally increases its Crit. DMG by <strong>15%</strong>, stacking up to <strong>4 </strong>times.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare:</p><ul><li><p>When the last stage of Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven hits a target inflicted with Electro Flare, it triggers <strong>1</strong> instance of Electro Flare DMG, with its DMG Multiplier equal to <strong>1500% </strong>times the Electro Flare DMG Multiplier corresponding to the current Electro Flare stacks on the target.</p></li></ul><p></p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S4</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">A River of Lanterns, a River of Wishes</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>When Resonators in the team inflict Electro Flare or Electro Rage to a target, or when Resonators in the team gain Unison or trigger Unison Response, all Resonators in the team gain <strong>20%</strong> All-Attribute DMG Bonus for <strong>30s</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S5</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">Forms Turn as the Heart Wills</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>While in Illumining Form, DMG taken by Hsin is reduced by <strong>20%</strong>.</p><p>When Hsin takes a fatal blow, She will not be knocked out, but instead restores <strong>100%</strong> of Max HP and becomes immune to DMG and interruption for <strong>1s</strong>. This effect can be triggered once every <strong>10 </strong>minute.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box"><div class="skill-header"><div class="skill-icon Electro">S6</div><div class="skill-info"><p class="skill-name">The Moon Owes Its Light to the Living</p></div></div><div class="skill-with-coloring dupe Electro"><div class="rte-plain"><p>Targets take <strong>40% </strong>more Resonance Skill DMG from Hsin.</p><p>Resonance Skill DMG dealt by Hsin ignores <strong>20% </strong>of the target's DEF.</p><p>While in Resonance Mode - Unison:</p><ul><li><p>The maximum stacks of the Unison Boon effect on Resonators in the team are increased by <strong>1</strong>. When a Resonator in the team triggers Unison Response, all Resonators in the team gain <strong>1</strong> stack of Unison Boon for <strong>30s</strong>. This effect does not stack.</p></li></ul><p>While in Resonance Mode - Electro Flare:</p><ul><li><p>While in combat, Electro Flare DMG taken by targets within a certain range around Hsin can be Critical, with Crit. Rate fixed at <strong>80%</strong> and Crit. DMG fixed at<strong> 230%</strong>.</p></li></ul><p></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Minor Fortes (Total)</div><div class="smaller-traces"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg-1420:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box trace"><div class="ww-stat"><img alt="CRIT Rate" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/icons/stat_crit.webp" style="color: transparent;"><span>CRIT Rate</span></div> <span class="value">+8%</span></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="box trace"><div class="ww-stat"><img alt="ATK%" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/icons/stat_atk.webp" style="color: transparent;"><span>ATK%</span></div> <span class="value">+12%</span></div></div></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Stats</div><div class="stats-header"><div class="info"><div class="custom-switch"><div class="switch" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; text-align: left; opacity: 1; direction: ltr; border-radius: 14px; transition: opacity 0.25s; touch-action: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); user-select: none;"><div class="react-switch-bg" style="height: 28px; width: 56px; margin: 0px; position: relative; background: rgb(72, 73, 80); border-radius: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.25s;"><div style="height: 28px; width: 30px; position: relative; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.25s;"><svg height="100%" width="100%" viewBox="-2 -5 17 21" style="position: absolute; top: 0px;"><path d="M11.264 0L5.26 6.004 2.103 2.847 0 4.95l5.26 5.26 8.108-8.107L11.264 0" fill="#fff" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div style="height: 28px; width: 30px; position: absolute; opacity: 1; right: 0px; top: 0px; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.25s;"><svg viewBox="-2 -5 14 20" height="100%" width="100%" style="position: absolute; top: 0px;"><path d="M9.9 2.12L7.78 0 4.95 2.828 2.12 0 0 2.12l2.83 2.83L0 