ill DMG Amplification, and ignore <b>8%</b> of the target's DEF when dealing damage.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>587</strong> | CRIT Rate: <strong>24.3%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">Solid alternative to Hsin's Signature in Flare teams, provides Hsin with Skill DMG and DEF Ignore as well as good base stats. Still far outclassed in Unison teams though for buff uptime reasons, which is an issue across all weapons but her Signature.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">76.20%</p><p class="second">80.60%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_2r_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_2q_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-5"><img alt="Stringmaster" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050016.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-5">Stringmaster (R1)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_2r_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_2q_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 196px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">Increases the DMG Bonus by <b>12%</b>. When dealing Resonan