Skill within 10s after casting Intro Skill or Basic Attacks grants 1 stacks of Gentle Dream. Echoes with the same name can only trigger this effect once, stacking up to 2 times, lasting for 10s. When reaching 2 stacks, casting Echo Skill no longer resets the duration of this effect. This effect activates up to once per 10s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect early.<br>With 1 stacks: Grants <b>40%</b> Basic Attack DMG Bonus.<br>With 2 stacks: Ignores <b>12%</b> of the target's Havoc RES.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>500</strong> | CRIT DMG: <strong>72%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">Mostly an ATK and CRIT DMG stat-stick for Hsin, barely benefits from this weapon's Basic Attack DMG-increasing effect but overall a negligible boost.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">71.00%</p><p class="second">77.80%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_2v_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_2u_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-5"><img alt="Freeze Frame" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050086.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-5">Freeze Frame (R1)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_2v_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_2u_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 196px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">Increases ATK by <b>12%</b>. After inflicting Glacio Chafe on the target, the wielder gains <b>30%</b> Glacio DMG Bonus for 12s, and all Resonators in the team gain <b>24%</b> ATK increase for 30s. Effects of the same name cannot be stacked.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>587</strong> | CRIT Rate: <strong>24.2%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">ATK and CRIT Rate stat-stick for Hsin, who does not benefit from this weapon's Glacio Chafe-related effects.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">69.80%</p><p class="second">75.90%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_31_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_30_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-5"><img alt="Luminous Hymn" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050046.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-5">Luminous Hymn (R1)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_31_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_30_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 248px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">Increase ATK by <b>12%</b>. Dealing DMG to targets with Spectro Frazzle grants the wielder <b>14%</b> Basic Attack DMG Bonus and <b>14%</b> Heavy Attack DMG Bonus, stacking up to 3 times for 6s. Casting Outro Skill Amplifies the Spectro Frazzle DMG on targets around the active Resonator by <b>30%</b> for 30s. Effects of the same name cannot be stacked.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>500</strong> | Crit. Rate: <strong>36%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">ATK and CRIT Rate stat-stick for Hsin, who does not benefit from this weapon's Spectro Frazzle-related effects. Overall worse than Freeze Frame due to a lower Base ATK (higher CRIT Rate isn't too beneficial due to a tendency to overcap on it).</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">69.80%</p><p class="second">75.90%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_33_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_32_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-5"><img alt="Forged Dwarf Star" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050076.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-5">Forged Dwarf Star (R1)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_33_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_32_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 274px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">Increases ATK by <b>12%</b>. After the wielder inflicts Fusion Burst or Tune Strain - Shifting on the target, their Resonance Liberation DMG Bonus is increased by <b>36%</b> for 5s. While this effect lasts, after Resonators in the team inflict Fusion Burst or Tune Strain - Shifting, their ATK is increased by <b>24%</b> for 15s. Effects of the same name cannot be stacked.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>500</strong> | CRIT Rate: <strong>36%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">Same as Luminous Hymn.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">66.00%</p><p class="second">70.30%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_35_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_34_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-5"><img alt="Cosmic Ripples" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050015.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-5">Cosmic Ripples (R1)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_35_" role="region" 