></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_37_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_36_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 118px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">When Resonance Liberation is released, increases the caster's ATK by <b>48%</b>, lasting for 15s.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>412</strong> | CRIT Rate: <strong>20.2%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">ATK and CRIT Rate stat-stick, this Battle Pass exclusive provides some decent stats for Hsin but they're generally lower and worse than 5-star weapons.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">58.70%</p><p class="second">64.10%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_39_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_38_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-4"><img alt="Fusion Accretion" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050084.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-4">Fusion Accretion (R5)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_39_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_38_" data-orientation="vertical" class="