ht: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 144px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">Casting Resonance Skill increases ATK by <b>28.8%</b> and grants <b>28.8%</b> Basic Attack DMG Bonus for 10s.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>412</strong> | CRIT DMG: <strong>40.5%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">This Battle Pass exclusive increases ATK and CRIT DMG and benefits Flare mode more than Unison mode, as multiple Skills are cast in Flare mode to ensure uptime on its ATK and Basic DMG% increasing buff. However, even still it's not recommended over any other 5-star due to low Base ATK issues.</div><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage split Electro"><p class="first">56.70%</p><p class="second">62.60%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-weapon-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_3d_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_3c_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-weapon-image rarity-4"><img alt="Jinzhou Keeper" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/weapons/21050044.webp" style="color: transparent;"></div><span class="ww-weapon-name rarity-4">Jinzhou Keeper (R5)</span></button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_3d_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_3c_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 144px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-content"><div class="skill-with-coloring">When Intro Skill is released, increases the caster's ATK by <b>16%</b> and HP by <b>20%</b>, lasting for <b>15</b>s.</div><div class="stats"><p>Stats at Level 90: ATK: <strong>387</strong> | ATK: <strong>36.4%</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information with-padding">Best permanently accessible weapon option for Unison Hsin, generally not sufficient and would replace with her Signature weapon as quickly as possible as it simply gives way better stats for her.</div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Best Echo Sets</div><div class="build-tips"><h6 class="text-lg">Best Echo Sets</h6><div class="single-item Electro"><div class="percentage"><p>100.00%</p></div><div><div class="pw-accordion tier-list-accordion ww-set-accordion" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-item" data-event-key="0"><div class="pw-accordion-header" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_3h_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_r_3g_" class="pw-accordion-button" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="ww-set-image Heart of Sworn Vigil"><img alt="Set" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/echo-sets/heart-of-sworn-vigil.webp" style="color: transparent; width: 50px; height: 50px;"></div>Heart of Sworn Vigil</button></div><div data-state="open" id="radix-_r_3h_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_r_3g_" data-orientation="vertical" class="pw-accordion-collapse" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 162px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 398.6517028808594px;"><div class="pw-accordion-body"><div class="ww-set-description"><div><span class="set-label">2 Set: </span><span><u>Electro DMG</u> <strong>+ 10%</strong>.</span></div><div><span class="set-label">5 Set: </span><span>Inflicting Electro Flare on the target, obtaining Unison, or triggering Unison Response increases the Resonator's Crit. Rate by <strong>15%</strong> and grants them <strong>22.5%</strong> <u>Electro DMG</u> for <strong>30s</strong>.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="information"><p>Hsin's Signature set gives her access to 15% CRIT Rate and 32.5% Electro DMG Bonus in total, making it the best blend of stats she has access to.</p><p>Below you can find Main Echo options:</p><ul class="ww-echo-list"><li><span aria-expanded="false"><div class="ww-echo-inline"><div><div class="ww-echo-cost rar-3"><img alt="Reminiscence: Suhsin the Inevitable" loading="lazy" width="35" height="35" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" src="https://cdn.prydwen.gg/images/wuthering-waves/monsters/6000225.webp" style="color: transparent; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;"></div><div class="ww-echo-name rar-3"><span>Reminiscence: Suhsin the Inevitable</span></div></div></div></span> - Simple Summon Echo, gives Hsin 20% Electro DMG Bonus when equipped in the main slot, making it her best by default for that reason alone.</li></ul></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Best Echo Stats</div><div class="build-tips"><div class="main-stats"><div class="box"><div class="stats-inside"><strong class="Overlord">4 cost</strong></div><div class="list-stats">CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG</div></div><div class="box"><div class="stats-inside"><strong class="Elite">3 cost</strong></div><div class="list-stats">Electro DMG</div></div><div class="box"><div class="stats-inside"><strong class="Elite">3 cost</strong></div><div class="list-stats">Electro DMG â‰¥ ATK%</div></div><div class="box"><div class="stats-inside"><strong class="Common">1 cost</strong></div><div class="list-stats">ATK%</div></div><div class="box"><div class="stats-inside"><strong class="Common">1 cost</strong></div><div class="list-stats">ATK%</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6"><div class="flex-1"><div class="box sub-stats"><p><span>Substats:</span> Energy Regen (Until Satisfied) &gt; CRIT Rate = CRIT DMG &gt; ATK% = Skill DMG% &gt; ATK </p></div></div></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Best Endgame Stats (Level 90)</div><p>All recommended endgame stats portray a fairly good quality endgame build as a goal to aim for on most characters. However, donâ€™t treat this as an end-all-be-all, and more of a suggestion.</p><p>All stat recommendations are given at S0 for 5-stars, S6 for 4-stars, and free characters (unless specified otherwise), <strong>based on total stats in the in-game stat-screen with the character out of combat but also active in the party</strong> (and hence some buffs may or may not apply). Any other precision may be directly specified. If not specified, Energy Regen requirements are estimated in the characterâ€™s best team.</p><div class="section-analysis"><div class="rte-plain box review raw"><ul><li><p style="text-align: justify;">HP: <strong>14500+</strong></p></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">DEF: <strong>1100+</strong></p></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">ATK: <strong>2100-2500+</strong></p></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">CRIT Rate: <strong>65%+</strong> (before Echo set bonuses)</p></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">CRIT DMG: <strong>230-270%+</strong></p></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">Energy Regen: <strong>110-115%</strong>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p style="text-align: justify;">Lower end was estimated in a Electro Rover/Suisui Flare team, higher end was estimated in a Jinhsi/Shorekeeper Unison team.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="text-align: justify;">Electro DMG Bonus: <strong>50-80%+</strong></p></li></ul><p></p></div></div><div class="content-header Electro"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="square" class="svg-inline--fa fa-square" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" width="18"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 96C0 60.7 28.7 32 64 32H384c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64V416c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V96z"></path></svg> Skill Priority</div><p>Below you can find the order of leveling the abilities for <strong class="Electro">Hsin</strong>.</p><h5 class="with-margin">Flare</h5><div class="skill-priority Electro"><div class="skill"><p>Forte Circuit</p></div><div class="order desktop"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="angles-right" class="svg-inline--fa fa-angles-right" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewB